      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 2000,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "# Context and unresolved identities\n\nNames retained from narrative, forewords, credits and notes. No affiliation edge is invented where evidence is absent. Fictional figures and cultural references are a separate class.\n\n[[00 Start Here|Guide]] · [[01 Map Index|All maps]] · [[03 Evidence and Open Questions|Evidence rules]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e98e03f329a1109",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** blue · **◆ INSTITUTION** purple · **■ COMPANY** amber · **▣ LAB / TEAM** green · **◇ CONTEXT** grey\n\n**V** green edges = primary-source checked. **B** amber edges = book report. Full evidence and dates are in the linked notes. Grouping is navigation, not a current org chart."
